+msgid "The shares of this system open without a user or a password, for anyone on your home network: open [B]{windows}[/B] in File Explorer, or [B]smb://{host}[/B] in a file manager on Mac or Linux, and connect as a guest.[CR][CR]Windows 11 (version 24H2 and later), and the Enterprise and Education editions of Windows 10 and 11, refuse a share without a password by default. There, turn Use Samba Password Authentication on in this page."
